-- A constant from a module that has no error of its own but imports one that
-- does: `l4 check export-imported-hop-mid.l4` refuses that module, so its
-- `clean` is refused (Blocking) rather than copied. Before, the export copied
-- `clean` as 5, because only the imported module's own errors were counted.
-- The export's exit code on this file is smucclaw/l4-ide#1110, not fixed here.
IMPORT `export-imported-hop-mid`

GIVEN h IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay2` h IS h TIMES `clean`
